  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-19 Impact Assessment  on Food Security, Nutrition, Livelihoods in Papua New Guinea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to enhance food security, nutrition, agriculture and livelihoods through informed decision making by policy makers on effective mitigation to address the impacts of COVID-19, through improved information and data. The outcome of the project is to enhance real-time information of the impacts of COVID-19 on food security, nutrition, agriculture and livelihoods. FAO will work with the government partners and members of the Food Security Cluster for the implementation of the impact assessment in the selected provinces which are also the high risk provinces of COVID-19.</narrative>
  </description>
